 @MarcusTheDorkus  I have very bright OLED capable of over 1200 nits and another miniLED capable of 1300 nits. 

Limiting them to 400 nits maximkum brightness mutes the image quite a bit on highlights.

Luckily OLED monitors get brighter with each new generation so in few years time there will be no need to choose the mode that limits the maximum.
